Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-Fifth Episode\NThe King's Ghost\NBanzai for the King!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.34,0:01:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Before we start today's story, let's recap what happened last week.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.46,0:02:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With the King missing and presumed dead,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.89,0:02:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire succeeded him to the throne.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.28,0:02:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, the villainous Duralumin and Nylon schemed to reveal that{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.80,0:02:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire is actually a girl...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.58,0:02:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...was exposed, and she was locked away{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.05,0:02:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}in terrifying Coffin Tower along with the Queen.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.33,0:02:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the spirited Sapphire didn't back down.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.56,0:02:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She escaped through the hole the mice showed her{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and became the mysterious Ribbon Knight, to punish Duralumin!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.69,0:02:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, Duralumin suspected the Ribbon Knight was{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire and sent an assassin to the Coffin Tower,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.52,0:02:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but they were easily driven off.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.76,0:02:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the relentless Duralumin won't give up.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.89,0:02:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This time, they bribe Gama,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the wicked jailer of the Coffin Tower, to catch Sapphire off guard.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.58,0:03:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Outside, a fierce storm rages with thunder and lightning.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.64,0:03:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Today's story begins just as Gama is about to attack Sapphire.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.16,0:03:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.40,0:04:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.40,0:04:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved Sapphire's life, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.16,0:04:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.76,0:04:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, Gama is knocked out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.27,0:04:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, we must tend to him right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But what on earth did Gama do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.84,0:04:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.53,0:04:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:05:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't trying to take your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.17,0:05:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, he's holding a dagger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.73,0:05:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he probably got scared by a mouse and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,slipped trying to chase it off with his dagger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, if we don't treat him, he'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.01,0:05:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be fine now. I'm sure he'll recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go boil some more water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.23,0:05:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.18,0:05:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Their guard is down this time, so make sure you finish them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.57,0:05:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Failure will not be tolerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.57,0:06:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I'll strike from behind, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.11,0:06:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.09,0:06:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.91,0:06:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Curse you, intruder!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama, you saved us, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.05,0:06:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama, thank you, thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.93,0:06:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.42,0:06:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.42,0:06:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch! It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.23,0:07:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.56,0:07:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.03,0:07:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Gama, mice are really cute, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they really are cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.65,0:07:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.98,0:07:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.44,0:07:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, if it isn't the Ribbon Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.40,0:08:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not picking on Princess Sapphire anymore, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.74,0:08:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true! I really have become a loyal servant to Princess Sapphire and the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's how it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.86,0:08:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's how it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.37,0:08:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemies of the Ribbon Knight are that centipede Duralumin and Nylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.23,0:08:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,To take those two down, I'd even break into the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What a terrifying princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.05,0:08:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of the castle, have you heard that rumor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A rumor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.54,0:08:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that in the dead of night, the ghost of the late king appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.21,0:08:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My father's ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.72,0:08:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who says they saw the ghost
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.08,0:08:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,or spreads rumors about it is sent to the quarry as a slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.33,0:08:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then if I go to the quarry, I can find out more about Father's ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.51,0:09:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the entrance to the quarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.51,0:09:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Security is pretty tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.89,0:09:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Close it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.94,0:09:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.02,0:09:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Close it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.72,0:09:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and close it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, but I'm coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.34,0:09:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.98,0:10:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.64,0:10:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your work more seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.71,0:10:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My throat's parched!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.97,0:10:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish the Ribbon Knight would show up here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.26,0:10:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ribbon Knight...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.57,0:10:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous, Ribbon Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.64,0:11:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just a children's fantasy, a dream. There's no way he exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.29,0:11:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Reality is much harsher.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.48,0:11:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just end up drying up in the sun out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.79,0:11:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Water?! No, it's impossible!\NReality is something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is probably just an illusion too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.36,0:11:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.18,0:11:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who splashed water on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Water! It's water!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.56,0:11:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's real water!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.08,0:11:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how dare you steal our water!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.92,0:11:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.14,0:11:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop picking on the weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.13,0:11:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That kid... Could it be the Ribbon Knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.77,0:11:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.89,0:11:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.18,0:12:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.01,0:12:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.48,0:12:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.60,0:12:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,In return, unchain everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.38,0:12:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Uranari!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:12:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Garigori!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.85,0:12:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanny!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.96,0:13:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know our names...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.80,0:13:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,P-Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.39,0:13:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.27,0:13:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy that you are safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.02,0:13:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.93,0:13:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, before that, there's something I want to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.03,0:13:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,About my father's ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.97,0:13:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.78,0:13:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who heard the King's voice or spread rumors was sent here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They heard his voice and footsteps?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.43,0:13:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So nobody actually saw him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.78,0:13:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has actually seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.06,0:13:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Every night around midnight, the King's voice and footsteps come from the basement...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.43,0:13:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...from the basement...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.63,0:13:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time the King's ghost starts walking around down there...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.72,0:14:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost time...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.28,0:14:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Under the lion ornament, the third stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.12,0:14:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.71,0:14:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.49,0:14:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.60,0:14:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the tomb...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's midnight...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.44,0:15:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Father's voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.61,0:15:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.98,0:16:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.90,0:16:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.69,0:16:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.70,0:16:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.59,0:16:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Sapphire...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.93,0:16:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.03,0:16:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So you survived as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.91,0:16:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, Mother is safe and well, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.43,0:16:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. I missed you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But who could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.81,0:16:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who trapped you in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.89,0:16:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.12,0:16:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't see what they looked like at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.04,0:16:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That night—the night I was attacked—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.88,0:16:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in my room writing an important decree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.64,0:17:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Thrown into this dungeon by an unknown enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trapped for six days without any food or water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.88,0:17:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So the enemy intended to starve you to death, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.40,0:17:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There is something even more important than that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.77,0:17:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.74,0:17:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I could retrieve the decree I wrote that night...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't it burned?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.91,0:17:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I wrote that on tanned leather,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.02,0:17:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,so it might have survived the fire. Sapphire, could you go fetch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.18,0:17:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He really got us good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.14,0:17:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.91,0:18:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.57,0:18:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ribbon Knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.92,0:18:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you talking in your sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.53,0:18:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Security is far too strict for anyone to get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.82,0:18:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.56,0:18:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is shining right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.51,0:18:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dark to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.52,0:18:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.54,0:18:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.85,0:18:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Lend me some light!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.89,0:18:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell what it says?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I can read it clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.99,0:18:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.89,0:18:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.70,0:19:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.37,0:19:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please read this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.18,0:19:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, these flyers are pasted all over town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.71,0:19:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,"Gather in front of the castle gates at 10 a.m. today, Ribbon Knight..."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.39,0:19:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What if something bad happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.27,0:19:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.14,0:19:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see something interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.22,0:19:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.03,0:19:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Drive them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.24,0:19:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot yourself at them or fire the cannons, just drive them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.56,0:19:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are way too many of them! We can't do a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.34,0:19:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.84,0:20:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, there is someone I want you to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.15,0:20:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.22,0:20:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a good look!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.24,0:20:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen?! How did she escape from the Coffin Tower... wait, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.87,0:20:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No way... But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.89,0:21:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The King is alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.44,0:21:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trapped in the castle dungeon by someone and nearly killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.63,0:21:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Regrettably, I don't know who was behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.14,0:21:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I survived and was rescued.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.14,0:21:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the Ribbon Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.23,0:21:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, Father. Let's go inside the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.65,0:21:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.81,0:21:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You are no longer the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.14,0:21:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic is the King now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.38,0:21:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence, Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.64,0:21:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This castle belongs to me and my heir, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.25,0:21:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Heir, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.57,0:21:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows that by Silverland law, a woman cannot be an heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.43,0:21:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. Until I change that foolish law. And I have changed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.30,0:21:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just change it on a whim.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.38,0:21:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Not without proof!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.59,0:21:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The proof is right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.96,0:21:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Official proof stamped with the royal seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.56,0:22:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I wrote this and affixed my seal before I was locked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.29,0:22:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.82,0:22:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I shall announce the decree changing the law before all our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.96,0:22:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I hereby change the law of Silverland that forbids women from taking the throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.82,0:22:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In the name of the King, I hereby decree that a woman may become queen and rule this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.24,0:22:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.36,0:22:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Papa, so I don't have to be king anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.24,0:22:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool, shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.26,0:22:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? I'm really not king anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.74,0:22:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, confound it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.39,0:22:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Banzai, banzai!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.12,0:22:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness, thank goodness! Banzai!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.69,0:22:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, let's step inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.10,0:22:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse them! Do they think I will just back down like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.36,0:22:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.18,0:23:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, it isn't right for a princess to be dressed like a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.01,0:23:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.61,0:23:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still want to dress as a boy for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.26,0:23:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stay like this until the evil is gone and true peace comes to this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.37,0:23:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep this dress safe until then.
